{"schema":1,"kind":"decision","id":"01KXP80FM4HGNF762W8H2FZD7M","title":"Replace split mutable authorization stores with a canonical v2 authority","decision":"Use one SQLite authority with BEGIN IMMEDIATE transactions, RFC 8785 JCS domain-separated Ed25519 envelopes, separate grant and ledger keys, append-only signed grant-state revisions, and exact-input single-use grants for the reference profile.","alternatives":[{"option":"Patch mutable Picto rows and add JSONL file locks","why_rejected":"signed old rows remain replayable and approval, consumption, and evidence still cannot commit atomically across stores"},{"option":"Use COSE with deterministic CBOR","why_rejected":"technically sound but expands the format and verifier dependency surface when interoperable JCS JSON is sufficient"},{"option":"Keep scope-wide or multi-use reference grants","why_rejected":"unnecessary replay and state-machine surface for the first strong guarantee; retain only in compatibility mode"}],"scope":["crates/gommage-core/src/authority.rs,crates/gommage-core/src/crypto_envelope.rs,crates/gommage-core/src/grant_v2.rs,crates/gommage-core/tests/authority_v2.rs,Cargo.toml"],"commits":["dc910d155fc9209301d98faca8c0e308cdd7d51a"],"author":"codex","confidence":"medium","tags":[],"ts":1784231771780}
